E AX3034 610-macro-ellipsis-misuse.ax:51:8-13 macro-ellipsis "macro `twice` has a rule with more than one `...`" !"a repeating element absorbs every argument left after the fixed ones (macro-system.md MAC-LANG-16), so a second has nothing defined to absorb and where the split fell would be the expander's guess" ?"keep one repeating element per rule; the arguments a second one would take are the ones the first already took"
E AX3034 610-macro-ellipsis-misuse.ax:55:8-14 macro-ellipsis "macro `shaped` repeats beneath a repeat" !"a repeated pattern binds each binder to one sequence; a `...` inside it would bind sequences of sequences (macro-system.md MAC-LANG-16)" ?"repeat one level only - `(m (f a) ...)` - and take deeper shapes apart across rules"
E AX3034 610-macro-ellipsis-misuse.ax:79:2-6 macro-ellipsis "`v` repeats, and this position takes one form" !"a template MUST use a repeated binding under an ellipsis of the same depth (macro-system.md MAC-LANG-16): a name bound to a SEQUENCE is many forms, and every position that takes one form needs to be told which" ?"write `... ` after it to splice every form it took, or match it with a non-repeating element" &610-macro-ellipsis-misuse.ax:59:8-12:"bare"
E AX3034 610-macro-ellipsis-misuse.ax:81:2-7 macro-ellipsis "`...` follows nothing that repeats" !"a template MUST use a repeated binding under an ellipsis of the same depth (macro-system.md MAC-LANG-16): a name bound to a SEQUENCE is many forms, and every position that takes one form needs to be told which" ?"put `...` directly after the name of a repeating element, or drop it" &610-macro-ellipsis-misuse.ax:63:8-13:"loose"
E AX3034 610-macro-ellipsis-misuse.ax:83:2-10 macro-ellipsis "`...` starts nothing - a repetition marker follows the declaration it repeats" !"a template MUST use a repeated binding under an ellipsis of the same depth (macro-system.md MAC-LANG-16): a name bound to a SEQUENCE is many forms, and every position that takes one form needs to be told which" ?"drop it, or move it directly after the repeated declaration" &610-macro-ellipsis-misuse.ax:71:8-16:"lonedecl"
E AX3034 610-macro-ellipsis-misuse.ax:85:2-10 macro-ellipsis "`...` nests a repeat inside a repeat" !"a template MUST use a repeated binding under an ellipsis of the same depth (macro-system.md MAC-LANG-16): a name bound to a SEQUENCE is many forms, and every position that takes one form needs to be told which" ?"repeat one level only - splice one declaration per element, never a declaration that splices again inside" &610-macro-ellipsis-misuse.ax:75:8-16:"nestdecl"
